[PrintTextModified Text:过道深处整齐排列着几扇厚实的门，<br>上面还挂着比囚犯的房间更严实的挂锁。|#0101Adv15_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:这里是什么地方呢？<br>虽然应该进不去里面……|#0101Adv15_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:门上面有个小窗，我们看一下里面吧。|#0101Adv15_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛战战兢兢地从小窗<br>看向了室内。|#0101Adv15_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; [back 21]
; ========================================
