@ModifyCamera Offset:-5,0 Zoom:0.5 Duration:0 Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.2

[PrintTextModified Text:哇！|#0101Adv15_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCamera Offset:0,0 Zoom:0 Duration:0 Lazy:false
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:3_1

[PrintTextModified Text:——看到室内充满邪气的物品，<br>艾玛瞬时脸色煞白，往后退了几步，然后跌坐在地上。|#0101Adv15_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:你没事吧，艾玛。<br>究竟有什么这么可怕的——|#0101Adv15_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉紧接着往里面探望，<br>神色也变得有些凝重。|#0101Adv15_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆冷静に感心している

[PrintTextModified Text:这些是……确实……蛮吓人的哦。|#0101Adv15_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; [back 3]
; ========================================

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3,ArmL1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:"（虽然看不太清楚，那些应该是拷问工具。<br>　如果反抗的话，就会被严刑拷打吗……？）|#0101Adv15_Ema003|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这里应该是典狱长说的惩罚室了。<br>说是，违反规定的囚犯会被关进里面。|#0101Adv15_Sherry004| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——就在这时。|#0101Adv15_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

; ボイス加工：ドア越しの声

[PrintTextModified Text:呜……该死的，开什么玩笑……|#0101Adv15_Alisa001| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ボイス加工：ドア越しの声

[PrintTextModified Text:放我出去！！呜啊啊啊啊！！|#0101Adv15_Alisa002| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛她们听见，在几间惩罚室的某处，<br>传来了亚里沙困兽般的呻吟声。|#0101Adv15_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆ハッと息を呑む

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:！|#0101Adv15_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:果然亚里沙是被关进了惩罚室里。|#0101Adv15_Sherry005| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:找一下她在哪里吧！|#0101Adv15_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛和雪莉轮番<br>往小窗里望去。|#0101Adv15_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; [back 21]
; ========================================

[PrintTextModified Text:不久后，她们找到了亚里沙。<br>她被囚禁在其中一间里面。|#0101Adv15_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙！|#0101Adv15_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

