@AnimateActorExtended ActorIds:Alisa-Front Loop:false ScenePositionY:35 EasingTypeName:EaseOutQuad Duration:0.5
@Wait WaitMode:0.4

[PrintTextModified Text:啊……？你们谁啊……|#0101Adv15_Alisa003| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙被绑在了十字架上，<br>看起来消耗了不少心神和体力。|#0101Adv15_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:此情此景实在令人心痛，艾玛感觉有些窒息。|#0101Adv15_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:你没事吧？<br>你遭了很过分的刑罚吗？|#0101Adv15_Sherry006| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙用尖锐的眼神<br>狠狠盯着她们两个。|#0101Adv15_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:跟你们没关系吧……|#0101Adv15_Alisa004| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……啊，不过我要给你们一个忠告。<br>之前我往远离宅邸的方向逃跑，<br>看到那边有一大堆怪物猫头鹰在监视。|#0101Adv15_Alisa005| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:它们一发现我，<br>马上就有看守赶过来了。越狱太难了。|#0101Adv15_Alisa006| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:有一道很高的围墙，我想把它烧掉，<br>但也做不到。有股神奇力量把我的火焰消除掉了……<br>到底是怎样，该死。|#0101Adv15_Alisa007| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（欸，要把围墙烧掉……？也太过于激进了……）|#0101Adv15_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR2,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:唔……我们是以囚犯身份被关押在这里的，<br>这座监狱肯定不会轻易让我们逃跑。<br>越狱难是理所当然的。|#0101Adv15_Sherry007| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:啧……你是过来取笑我的对吧！<br>滚一边去！滚蛋！！|#0101Adv15_Alisa008| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

