@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:看来她蛮精神的耶。|#0101Adv15_Sherry008| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:根据规定，她明天就会被放出来了。<br>总之，知道她没事就是好事。|#0101Adv15_Sherry009| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯，说得对……|#0101Adv15_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR2,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:连脚镣都戴上了，好可怜……|#0101Adv15_Sherry010| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯？记得亚里沙她<br>好像一开始就已经戴着脚镣了。|#0101Adv15_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR1,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:哎呀，是这样吗！<br>那她一下子就进入高难模式了呢。<br>她应该是被当成需要重点留意的对象了吧。|#0101Adv15_Sherry011| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可能是吧……|#0101Adv15_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

